Issue No.3: As per final order, for the following;
REASONS 10. Issue No.1:- In order to explain the actionable negligence of the driver of offending vehicle,
P.W.1 has filed his affidavit explaining the vivid picture of the accident that took place on 06-09-2023 at about 7-20 pm., when the petitioner was riding a Motorcycle bearing Reg.No.KA-05-LP-9633 on 1st main road, Jayanagar 8th Block, Bangalore, at that time the driver of Car bearing Reg.No.KA-17-7978 (hereinafter referred to as the offending vehicle) came in a rash and negligent manner and dashed against the petitioner motorcycle, result of which the petitioner fell down and sustained grievous injuries.
